Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(fusion): local-llama is always the managed worker,
 whatever its URL (ATO-1562)

In managed mode the local-llama entry's URL is built from the daemon's
port, not from localModels.url, so the URL check read our own server as
a foreign one and dropped the managed model from the run-mode label
(channel /model tests for a fusion deployment caught it).

(cherry picked from commit 81cd5a04099ac60aa78ef93c714dbc721f4d9931)
